{"bindings":{"A":{"coverage":[],"dateCount":80,"description":"日本橡胶进口采用日本 e-Stat 官方贸易统计（JSON API 增量），覆盖 2020-01 至 2026-08。日本橡胶总进口仅包括 HS 4001；不包括 HS 4005 复合胶和 HS 400280 混合胶。橡胶总进口（折干）＝HS 400110 乳胶实报重量×0.60＋HS 400121、400122、400129、400130 实报重量。进口分国家按更新月当年累计进口量排序，页面展示前四位。半钢胎为 HS 401110，全钢胎为 HS 401120；半钢胎单胎重量按9.3 kg、折耗胶系数按20%，全钢胎单胎重量按35 kg、折耗胶系数按35%。有实报轮胎重量时，折耗胶＝半钢胎实报重量×20%＋全钢胎实报重量×35%；仅有条数时，估算重量＝条数×单胎重量，折耗胶再按对应系数计算。日本海关国家代码 516 对应科特迪瓦（旧称象牙海岸），页面统一显示为“科特迪瓦”。日本轮胎进口分国家按更新月当年累计折耗胶排序，展示前6位；伙伴国缺失月份保持缺失，不插值、不补零。日本轮胎进口采用实报重量，轮胎出口采用实报重量。","id":"system_5b62d265bf84ce596dbfdeea","label":"日本自科特迪瓦进口橡胶","missingCommonCount":24,"unit":"万吨","validCount":56}},"cache":{"computedAt":"2026-10-23T09:32:07+08:00","key":"94d30b171f18d68aa36fdd6a7ede4089ded23d478eadf530335f31291553acf1","sourceVersion":"961aef661386840ade065cf628c4a537dd642c1d768994513ae1a75d7ae25833","state":"ready"},"comparisonPoints":[],"endDate":"2026-08-01","expression":"A","frequency":"monthly","inferredUnit":"万吨","missingPointCount":24,"missingPolicy":"intersection dates; missing values stay missing; division by zero is missing","ok":true,"parameters":{"fullYear":false},"points":[{"date":"2020-01-01","day":1,"month":"2020-01","monthNumber":1,"value":null,"valueKt":null,"year":2020},{"date":"2020-02-01","day":1,"month":"2020-02","monthNumber":2,"value":null,"valueKt":null,"year":2020},{"date":"2020-03-01","day":1,"month":"2020-03","monthNumber":3,"value":null,"valueKt":null,"year":2020},{"date":"2020-04-01","day":1,"month":"2020-04","monthNumber":4,"value":null,"valueKt":null,"year":2020},{"date":"2020-05-01","day":1,"month":"2020-05","monthNumber":5,"value":null,"valueKt":null,"year":2020},{"date":"2020-06-01","day":1,"month":"2020-06","monthNumber":6,"value":null,"valueKt":null,"year":2020},{"date":"2020-07-01","day":1,"month":"2020-07","monthNumber":7,"value":null,"valueKt":null,"year":2020},{"date":"2020-08-01","day":1,"month":"2020-08","monthNumber":8,"value":null,"valueKt":null,"year":2020},{"date":"2020-09-01","day"